# World Cup 2022 – Data Analysis (Power BI)

## 📌 Project Overview
This project analyzes data from the FIFA World Cup 2022 using Power BI.  
The goal is to explore tournament performance, goals, teams, and matches through interactive dashboards and clear visualizations.

## 🎯 Objectives
- Analyze overall tournament statistics
- Explore team performance and goal distribution
- Provide an interactive dashboard for data exploration

## 🛠️ Tools Used
- Power BI
- DAX
- Data cleaning and transformation
- CSV datasets

## 📊 Key Metrics
- Total matches
- Total goals
- Average goals per match
- Team performance metrics

