## 🗄️ Data Source
The datasets used in this project are based on publicly available World Cup 2022 data and were cleaned and transformed for analysis.

## 📁 Repository Structure
- `world_cup_2022.pbix` → Power BI dashboard
- `data/` → datasets used
- `screenshots/` → dashboard previews

## 📈 Outcome
The dashboard provides a clear overview of the World Cup 2022, enabling users to explore key insights and performance metrics through an intuitive interface.
